      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, I don't understand why they decided to go this route. \n\nAlso, the \"Sorted By\" button is literally useless **on the main page**, it just redirects to the sorted page, should be merged into the filters modal. \n\nThis is how it should be.",
