  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think the button for filtering/searching should be a lot more prominent. It is arguably the most important feature the marketplace UI has so it should be a lot easier to notice and click. I think replacing it with a \"search\" button similar to the one in the world tab / after you click the existing button would be ideal since searching still implies filtering.",
